    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "ħittin",
      "rationale": "חציו\/והחציו: 'nofshom u nofshom' — il-Lhudi jgħid 'in-nofs tiegħu u n-nofs', dettal tal-qsim mitluf fil-plural Malti."
